    },
    "Closing the window or pressing ⌘Q hides Lite Gemini and its Dock icon instead of quitting. Open Lite Gemini again or press the show/hide shortcut to bring it back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭窗口或按 ⌘Q 时，Lite Gemini 会隐藏并移除 Dock 图标，而不是退出。再次打开 Lite Gemini 或按显示/隐藏快捷键即可恢复。"
          }
        }
