    "Lite Gemini turns on Gemini's temporary chat whenever a new chat opens. If you turn it off in a chat, it stays off until the next new chat." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次打开新对话时，Lite Gemini 会自动开启 Gemini 的临时会话。在某个对话里手动关闭后，到下一个新对话前都保持关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
